26:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","$L16",null,{"label":"High Fidelity Design","title":"The Final","accent":"Screens","sub":"The flows that removed the email round-trip — candidate status, tender listings, and the module surfaces around them."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-ink/12 bg-ink/[0.022] p-4 md:p-8","children":["$","$L15",null,{"src":"/figmaAssets/mask-group.png","alt":"Collage of high-fidelity mobile design screens for the HSL website","width":1200,"height":1071,"className":"block h-auto w-full"}]}]]}]
27:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","$L16",null,{"label":"Outcomes & Impact","title":"What Actually","accent":"Shipped"}],["$","$L17",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/75","children":"The redesigned ecosystem went live. The clearest signal of impact came from the teams who had been absorbing the problem: with candidate status and tender information now published in the product, HR and the tender cell reported a noticeable drop in inbound status calls — the work that had been done by phone was now being done by the interface."}]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mb-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","li","Shipped to production",{"children":["$","$L33",null,{"className":"h-full","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-[color:var(--accent)]"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[13px] font-bold text-ink","children":"Shipped to production"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"The redesign went live across the modules in scope, rather than ending as a prototype or a pitch deck."}]]}]}],["$","li","Fewer status calls to HR and tenders",{"children":["$","$L33",null,{"className":"h-full","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-[color:var(--accent)]"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[13px] font-bold text-ink","children":"Fewer status calls to HR and tenders"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"Both teams reported reduced inbound calls and emails once applicants and vendors could check their own status. The support burden moved from people to the product."}]]}]}],["$","li","Applying is no longer a black box",{"children":["$","$L33",null,{"className":"h-full","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-[color:var(--accent)]"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[13px] font-bold text-ink","children":"Applying is no longer a black box"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"Candidates can log in and see their submitted resume and whether they are selected, rejected, or in process — replacing an indefinite wait for an email."}]]}]}],["$","li","Tender information left the inbox",{"children":["$","$L33",null,{"className":"h-full","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-[color:var(--accent)]"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[13px] font-bold text-ink","children":"Tender information left the inbox"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"Live tenders, requirements, and updates moved onto the platform, making the site the authoritative source instead of a mail thread."}]]}]}],["$","li","Five modules, one system",{"children":["$","$L33",null,{"className":"h-full","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-[color:var(--accent)]"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[13px] font-bold text-ink","children":"Five modules, one system"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"A shared IA, component set, and accessibility baseline across recruitment, tenders, vendor management, vigilance, and the public portfolio."}]]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/60","children":"What I took from it"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","$L33","The brief was a website redesign; the problem was status visibility. Had I designed to the brief as written, HSL would have received a better-looking version of the same bottleneck. The stakeholder walkthroughs — asking what people get asked on the phone — are what reframed it, and that question is now the first one I ask on any operational product.",{"children":"$L50"}],"$L51","$L52"]}]]}]]}]
28:["$","$L53",null,{"firstTake":"I took the brief at face value: the platform was outdated and non-responsive, so this was a visual and responsive redesign across five modules.","whatChangedIt":"The stakeholder sessions kept returning to the same thing, and it was never layout. Staff were spending a large part of the day answering “where does mine stand?” — the system already held every status, but only a person could release it.","whatIDid":"Reframed the project from a redesign to a status-visibility problem, and reran Define against that. The candidate portal and the tenders dashboard exist because of that reframe; a purely visual refresh would have shipped and changed nothing.","cost":"The first round of module wireframes was scrapped, and Empathize/Define ran considerably longer than planned."}]
