3a:["$","$L33","Tenders & vendor teams",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h4 mb-4 text-ink","children":"Tenders & vendor teams"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","li","How does a vendor find out a tender is live, and that something changed?",{"className":"border-l-2 border-[color:var(--accent-border)] pl-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"How does a vendor find out a tender is live, and that something changed?"}],["$","li","What do you re-send by email that already exists somewhere?",{"className":"border-l-2 border-[color:var(--accent-border)] pl-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"What do you re-send by email that already exists somewhere?"}],["$","li","How does a vendor confirm you received their submission?",{"className":"border-l-2 border-[color:var(--accent-border)] pl-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"How does a vendor confirm you received their submission?"}],["$","li","Which questions could a page answer instead of you?",{"className":"border-l-2 border-[color:var(--accent-border)] pl-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"Which questions could a page answer instead of you?"}]]}]]}]
3b:["$","$L33","Vigilance & portfolio owners",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h4 mb-4 text-ink","children":"Vigilance & portfolio owners"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","li","What has to stay exactly as it is for compliance?",{"className":"border-l-2 border-[color:var(--accent-border)] pl-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"What has to stay exactly as it is for compliance?"}],["$","li","Who reads this module, and what are they trying to find?",{"className":"border-l-2 border-[color:var(--accent-border)] pl-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"Who reads this module, and what are they trying to find?"}],["$","li","Where does your terminology differ from the other branches?",{"className":"border-l-2 border-[color:var(--accent-border)] pl-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"Where does your terminology differ from the other branches?"}]]}]]}]
3c:["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/60","children":"Key insights"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","$L33","Applying was a black box. A candidate submitted, then got no signal of any kind — no acknowledgement, no stage, no outcome — until an email arrived, if one arrived. The anxiety came from an invisible process, not a slow one. This became the clearest design mandate in the project.",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-[color:var(--accent)]","children":"01"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h4 mb-3 text-ink","children":["Applying was a black box","."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"A candidate submitted, then got no signal of any kind — no acknowledgement, no stage, no outcome — until an email arrived, if one arrived. The anxiety came from an invisible process, not a slow one. This became the clearest design mandate in the project."}]]}],["$","$L33","Tender information lived in inboxes rather than on the platform, which made the authoritative record a message thread: impossible to search, easy to miss, inconsistent between recipients.",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-[color:var(--accent)]","children":"02"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h4 mb-3 text-ink","children":["Tender information lived in inboxes rather than on the platform, which made the authoritative record a message thread: impossible to search, easy to miss, inconsistent between recipients.","."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":""}]]}],["$","$L33","Staff were being used as a status lookup. Teams described spending a significant part of the day on \"where does mine stand?\" calls — a design problem showing up as a staffing cost.",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-[color:var(--accent)]","children":"03"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h4 mb-3 text-ink","children":["Staff were being used as a status lookup","."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"Teams described spending a significant part of the day on \"where does mine stand?\" calls — a design problem showing up as a staffing cost."}]]}],["$","$L33","Five modules meant five mental models. Each had grown separately, with its own navigation logic and terminology, so users crossing between them had to relearn the site.",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-[color:var(--accent)]","children":"04"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h4 mb-3 text-ink","children":["Five modules meant five mental models","."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"Each had grown separately, with its own navigation logic and terminology, so users crossing between them had to relearn the site."}]]}],["$","$L33","Accessibility could not be a finishing pass. A public-sector body serving applicants, vendors and the general public across a wide range of devices and connections has to start there.",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-[color:var(--accent)]","children":"05"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h4 mb-3 text-ink","children":["Accessibility could not be a finishing pass","."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65","children":"A public-sector body serving applicants, vendors and the general public across a wide range of devices and connections has to start there."}]]}]]}]]}]
